          "text_sha256": "c1a2dc8396c126479a5145f33423aa4c1558bf60e84e9825cce930589723559d",
          "excerpt": "11\nWhile these things were carrying on, Quintus Fabius Pictor, the ambassador, returned from Delphi to Rome, and read the response of the oracle from a written copy."
        },
        {
          "document_id": "livy_history_of_rome_books_9_26",
